ecting your own background music directly from the menu, and carve your path through the horde with style. Sharpen your blade \u2014 survival demands it.", "short_description": "Unleash your inner demon as you slice through waves of zombies with your katana in this intense VR action experience."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/11pzn2FMvzefXI1CQbgoZJ4qe6h-OAN2oOHnQDPZnXM8/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Taqo Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://secret-adjustment-848.notion.site/Taqo-Games-Official-Website-2ae914827180802ea420de23e9eb2d80?source=copy_link", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1672577396871977"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25379725591716852"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822307_2063949624354425_1894635615695093769_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=45-AiiRWaNEQ7kNvwHN3by7&_nc_oc=AdofEw-VOnjZcZQlUbLwVk-oF-lsmlx3ybuHzLTuc-OsuvKNSJm6g7qdwrv1sqgtjBE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af1iWNzbWfbZ37o_fw0ExnlSi37C8uv4fxOTn5pC8Un7cA&oe=69F0B5B4"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Corpsebound VR", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "con